    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "<p>This bridge is KuruShima Kaikyo Bridge and taken at Sunrize Itoyama (Imabari , Ehime prefecture).\nFor more detail...\n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.jnto.go.jp/eng/location/regional/hiroshima/shimanamikaidou.html\">http://www.jnto.go.jp/eng/location/regional/hiroshima/shimanamikaidou.html</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;www.jnto.go.jp/eng/location/regional/hiroshima/shimanamik...&lt;/a&gt;\n来島海峡大橋です。\n</p>\nしまなみ海道の愛媛側入り口、サンライズ糸山から撮ったものです。",
